{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e09-scene-19",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "手里唯一的一张牌  (The Only Card Left to Play)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Determined to solve the artist boycott for Chun Yuqiao, Bu Xiaogu seeks advice from Xingtian's artist-management director. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "新一季十二歌王的改版方案真的特别好，做出来肯定会刷新市场，又是一个爆款。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但现在各方都特别保守，几个大牌艺人的经纪方都拒不配合。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您是星天艺人经纪方面的专家，您有什么办法吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "经纪公司都是从商业价值考量，所以你讲别的道理肯定说不通。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我觉得可以绕开经纪方，直接从艺人本身下手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您是指哪位艺人呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "当然是惠美啊，她是我们手里唯一的一张牌。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "依靠她的影响力，这件事情是有可能完成的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "但是作为经纪部的艺人总监，我不太方便直接跟她说这个事，希望你能理解。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的只能去求惠美吗？就没有别的办法了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "小谷，你对惠美是有什么顾忌吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没有，为了搬开改版的阻力，我回去好好想想办法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "加油！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "新一季十二歌王的改版方案真的特别好，做出来肯定会刷新市场，又是一个爆款。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The revamp plan for the new season of Twelve Singers is truly great; once produced, it will refresh the market as another smash hit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但现在各方都特别保守，几个大牌艺人的经纪方都拒不配合。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet every side is very conservative right now, and the agencies for several big stars refuse to cooperate.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您是星天艺人经纪方面的专家，您有什么办法吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are Xingtian's expert in artist management—do you see any way forward?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "经纪公司都是从商业价值考量，所以你讲别的道理肯定说不通。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Talent agencies judge everything by commercial value, so arguing any other angle definitely will not get through.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "我觉得可以绕开经纪方，直接从艺人本身下手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I think you can bypass the agencies and approach a star directly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您是指哪位艺人呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Which artist are you referring to?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "当然是惠美啊，她是我们手里唯一的一张牌。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huimei, of course—she is the single trump card in our hand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "依靠她的影响力，这件事情是有可能完成的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Counting on her influence, pulling this off is genuinely possible.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "但是作为经纪部的艺人总监，我不太方便直接跟她说这个事，希望你能理解。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'However, as talent director of the management department, it is awkward for me to ask her directly; I hope you understand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的只能去求惠美吗？就没有别的办法了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Must we really go beg Huimei? Is there truly no other way?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "小谷，你对惠美是有什么顾忌吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, do you have some hesitation when it comes to Huimei?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没有，为了搬开改版的阻力，我回去好好想想办法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not at all; to clear away the obstacles to the revamp, I will go back and think carefully.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "加油！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Keep at it!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "新一季十二歌王的改版方案真的特别好，做出来肯定会刷新市场，又是一个爆款。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但现在各方都特别保守，几个大牌艺人的经纪方都拒不配合。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您是星天艺人经纪方面的专家，您有什么办法吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "经纪公司都是从商业价值考量，所以你讲别的道理肯定说不通。",
      "gap": 0.5
